# Shipped to the root of the `deploy` branch, which cPanel checks out as the
# live document root. Files the server writes there (PHP's error_log next to
# the api/ scripts, for example) would otherwise be untracked changes, and
# cPanel refuses "Deploy HEAD Commit" while the checkout has any. Not served:
# the .htaccess deny-list refuses every dotfile.
error_log
php_errorlog
